session-status adapts code from two MIT licensed mods: hooks/meter.ts and the
meter's drawing and timers in hooks/register.tsx from sub-meter
(https://github.com/midudev/better-claude), and hooks/context.ts and the
context refresh in hooks/register.tsx from context-bar
(https://github.com/hamzafer/claude-code-mods). Their notices follow.

